## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Plan memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus type-specific lifecycle slots:

- **`status`** — `draft` / `active` / `complete` / `paused` / `cancelled` / `abandoned`
- **`stage`** — current stage name (e.g., "Stage 3 of 5: tooling")
- **`started`** / **`completed`** — date markers
- **`parent`** / **`primary-parent`** / **`blocks`** — arc-forest DAG fields
- **`triggered-by`** — what surfaced this arc

